<section style="padding: 5rem 1.5rem; text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1E293B 0%, #0f172a 100%);">
  <div style="max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <h2 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); font-weight: 700; color: white; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.2;">¿Listo para calcular tu presupuesto?</h2>
